  <completion>Done 2026-11-25: PR #3092 squash-merged to master (b005279c4d, Closes #3040 and #3020) after an independent Opus adversarial review (no F1-F3) and one fix round (F4: "an opened date"; the metadata comment names the Redis-outage behaviour). Columns are named by a static display-name map over the 50 authorable columns, guarded against the allow-list and SpaarkeMaster Entity.xml (mutation-proven); the authoring catalog carries an additive fieldLabels field the RuleWizard shows. Choice/status values in the plain line read by label from the existing MetadataService (app identity, Redis 6 h, org-wide), only when a rule tests a choice value, falling back to the number on any failure; formal line, stored bodies and tokens unchanged. Known limits: one Redis GET per table per description for choice tests; "Status" vs "Status Reason" wording; app-identity labels up to 6 h stale. Dev check after the next uac-r2 dev BFF build and the Console auto-deploy.</completion>
</task>
